<title>USA: PHLX, AMEX set options listings for next week.</title>
<headline>PHLX, AMEX set options listings for next week.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said  Friday it will list options on three stocks on August 5 and on another  one August 7.</p>
<p>In addition, the American Stock Exchange said it will list options  on Valence Technology Inc on August 8.</p>
<p>On August 5, the PHLX will begin trading options on General Scanning  Inc, St. Paul Bancorp Inc and Universal Outdoor Holdings Inc. It will  begin trading Terex Corp options on August 7.  </p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols, the options'  strike prices, expiration months, position limits and specialist.</p>
<p>Ticker	Strikes	 Expir	 Pos Lts  Specialist</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    15, 17-1/2,   Sep, Oct,   4,500    Penn Options</p>
<p>		20		Jan, Apr</p>
<p>    20, 22-1/2,   Sep, Oct,   4,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>		25		Jan, Apr		 Group</p>
<p>    30, 35, 40    Sep, Oct,   4,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>				  Jan, Apr		 Group</p>
<p>     17-1/2, 20,   Sep, Oct,   4,500    GPZ Trading</p>
<p>		22-1/2	  Jan, Apr</p>
<p>    5, 7-1/2,     Sep, Oct,   7,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>		10		Dec, Mar		 Group</p>
